                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "86051c21-fdbe-3c63-b080-dc6ab4faa325",
                        "entry_id": "3102b519-1984-3205-95df-ebbeb232274c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. сообразующий свое поведение с мнением окружающих; учитывающий жизненные обстоятельства, условия"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c3554dd5-65c8-4725-8595-6db14c0aa088",
                                "sense_id": "86051c21-fdbe-3c63-b080-dc6ab4faa325",
                                "text": "При этом фрагменты личности обычно включают как отрицательный образ агрессивного, преступного «другого», так и «хороший», как правило, субмиссивный, конформный образ."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3cc62aa6-c2a8-3a81-b750-4297d63edf8d",
                        "entry_id": "3102b519-1984-3205-95df-ebbeb232274c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "матем. сохраняющий при отображении, преобразовании и т. п. углы между линиями, пересекающимися внутри области"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5a8df4f5-5eca-454d-8648-00684450ea17",
                        "source_entry_id": "3102b519-1984-3205-95df-ebbeb232274c",
                        "target_lang_word": "conformal",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "conformal",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "81b4aabf-e3a1-390a-9040-11f0041b72f5",
                                        "entry_id": "f64eb0b3-4813-34ad-bba5-523267d95069",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That conforms, especially to the shape of something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54a5c8af-0bde-4582-8de0-0bc9ce082213",
                                                "sense_id": "81b4aabf-e3a1-390a-9040-11f0041b72f5",
                                                "text": "Some are realizable in practical computational times; others giving ‘more conformal’ 3D dose distributions take longer and some invoke technology which is not readily available, such as intensity-modulated fields."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b32b3373-90db-40c6-bf82-2953ab9159ed",
                                                "sense_id": "81b4aabf-e3a1-390a-9040-11f0041b72f5",
                                                "text": "CVD^([Chemical Vapor Deposition]) is generally more conformal than physical vapor deposition, meaning that it covers a rough surface relatively uniformly, tracking the morphology rather than resulting in thin, low-quality coatings on vertical walls of the substrate, as is the case for physical vapor deposition methods."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4eb5c58-ac99-477e-ac67-e4029f639f34",
                                                "sense_id": "81b4aabf-e3a1-390a-9040-11f0041b72f5",
                                                "text": "One method for delivering high doses of radiation to a small area is by using more conformal types of radiotherapy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "96e8ab41-3da7-3dff-a16e-cf1f80ec17a0",
                                        "entry_id": "f64eb0b3-4813-34ad-bba5-523267d95069",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That preserves angles between intersecting curves."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a transformation"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cced0877-4ba5-4749-90ad-c52718d83764",
                                                "sense_id": "96e8ab41-3da7-3dff-a16e-cf1f80ec17a0",
                                                "text": "1991 [Elsevier Science], Roland Schinzinger, Patricio A. A. Laura, Conformal Mapping: Methods and Applications, 2003, Dover, page 508,\nThis would have been tantamount to a conformal transformation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9976fcd-6736-4b77-8988-3c5e86183eab",
                                                "sense_id": "96e8ab41-3da7-3dff-a16e-cf1f80ec17a0",
                                                "text": "Let us find all conformal transformations in d dimensions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d298db4d-ccf4-4177-9bc9-d18bb1cbc371",
                                                "sense_id": "96e8ab41-3da7-3dff-a16e-cf1f80ec17a0",
                                                "text": "In regions of S where the packings become more deeply embedded in purely hexagonal generations during refinement, the local dilatation approaches 1 and the maps become progressively more conformal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb3e94f0-2be5-39f8-8c8c-516bbc44ba1c",
                                        "entry_id": "f64eb0b3-4813-34ad-bba5-523267d95069",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That preserves relative angles over small scales, at all but a limited number of distinct points."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a map projection"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81b24bd6-6a8d-4f1e-8a8e-5c244f4d7f33",
                                                "sense_id": "eb3e94f0-2be5-39f8-8c8c-516bbc44ba1c",
                                                "text": "On conformal map projections, the scale depends on location only and not direction."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "162db7bb-bb35-4844-9f9c-dfc3691890e0",
                        "source_entry_id": "3102b519-1984-3205-95df-ebbeb232274c",
                        "target_lang_word": "conforme",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "conforme",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ad6758a-5d95-3af4-93b3-f406cf203020",
                                        "entry_id": "918b2753-1a5f-39d7-97a8-26c8f5a0270c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Se dice de lo que tiene un parecido o semejanza que lo hace afín con algo."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90a444a9-fbec-46b1-8041-52018009a1ed",
                                                "sense_id": "1ad6758a-5d95-3af4-93b3-f406cf203020",
                                                "text": "El sombrero está conforme con el resto de la vestimenta."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f6efd033-e9fa-3513-b5e0-00377a81dfe2",
                                        "entry_id": "918b2753-1a5f-39d7-97a8-26c8f5a0270c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Se dice de lo que conviene a algo."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85226152-8662-43da-8c26-2db29849b515",
                                                "sense_id": "f6efd033-e9fa-3513-b5e0-00377a81dfe2",
                                                "text": "En la playa usamos ropa ligera conforme con el calor."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e61f7c89-7ac6-35c1-8fae-72264389865d",
                                        "entry_id": "918b2753-1a5f-39d7-97a8-26c8f5a0270c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Que se ha llegado a un punto de entendimiento y acuerdo con otros."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4edca7f3-6da1-4342-b00e-5a941d3e9d5d",
                                                "sense_id": "e61f7c89-7ac6-35c1-8fae-72264389865d",
                                                "text": "Estamos conformes con el arreglo."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac5ae643-0144-3674-8392-f393ddbecaf5",
                                        "entry_id": "918b2753-1a5f-39d7-97a8-26c8f5a0270c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Que se acepta hasta donde se llegó, que se sobrelleva co paciencia."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54f77c64-9d99-4a69-b591-d53c7652f4e2",
                                                "sense_id": "ac5ae643-0144-3674-8392-f393ddbecaf5",
                                                "text": "Ya estamos conformes con nuestro fracaso."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"4\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
